d the 212 actress had an emotional  time reading the script and while she  had mixed feelings it got her excited  and she was eventually thankful for the  whole dreamlike experience  actor carlo aquino really regretted not  being able to be part of squid game  especially after he'd been specifically  requested by the director to audition  the actor had given such a memorable  performance in a past project squid  games director requested he do a tape  for the part of ali  one which he really did suit and  actually booked the job for  unfortunately because travel  restrictions were in place aquino wound  up not being able to film the show lucky  for us anupam tripathi jumped into the  role but still a tough break for aquino  while he didn't end up in the series he  still managed to get himself a green  tracksuit  since there aren't many foreign actors  in korea the pandemic travel  restrictions really proved to be a  challenge when the team was seeking out  performers to play the vips in the show  vip number four the one we hear speak  the most was found and brought over from  thailand to shoot while the rest were  really selected because they didn't have  that many options  these extras auditioned and eventually  booked the jobs playing the despicable  vips  the creator of squid game definitely  lucked out in terms of the cast who  signed on to be part of this special  project which character would you want  to play
 

